###
### Rakshak-AI Geospatial Backend REST API Test Suite
### Compatible with VS Code REST Client / IntelliJ HTTP Client
###

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000

### 1. System Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
Content-Type: application/json

### 2. Root API Information
GET {{baseUrl}}/
Content-Type: application/json

### 3. List All Hospitals (Unfiltered)
GET {{baseUrl}}/hospitals
Content-Type: application/json

### 4. List Hospitals Near Koramangala (within 7 km radius)
# Expected: Returns St. John's, Narayana HSR, Manipal Old Airport Rd, etc. sorted by distance
GET {{baseUrl}}/hospitals?near=12.9343,77.6190&radius_km=7
Content-Type: application/json

### 5. Create Incident in Indiranagar / Domlur
# Location: 12.9654, 77.6432 (near Old Airport Road)
# PostGIS Query: Evaluates ST_DWithin (8000m) & has_trauma_center = true
# Note: Manipal Old Airport Rd (~1.0 km) and St. John's (~4.4 km) should match.
# Non-trauma centers like Chinmaya Mission are automatically filtered out.
# @name createIndiranagarIncident
POST {{baseUrl}}/incidents
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "latitude": 12.9654,
  "longitude": 77.6432,
  "victim_metadata": {
    "passengers": 2,
    "impact_g_force": 8.7,
    "airbag_deployed": true,
    "vehicle_model": "Tata Nexon EV",
    "speed_at_impact_kmh": 68
  }
}

### Store Incident ID from previous request
@indiranagarIncidentId = {{createIndiranagarIncident.response.body.incident.id}}

### 6. Create Incident in Whitefield
# Location: 12.9850, 77.7280 (near ITPL Main Road)
# PostGIS Query: Manipal Hospital Whitefield is ~0.5 km away and should be #1.
POST {{baseUrl}}/incidents
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "latitude": 12.9850,
  "longitude": 77.7280,
  "victim_metadata": {
    "passengers": 1,
    "impact_g_force": 12.4,
    "airbag_deployed": true,
    "vehicle_model": "Hyundai Creta",
    "speed_at_impact_kmh": 82
  }
}

### 7. Get Incident Details by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/incidents/{{indiranagarIncidentId}}
Content-Type: application/json

### 8. Update Incident Status -> "broadcasting"
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/incidents/{{indiranagarIncidentId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "broadcasting"
}

### 9. Update Incident Status -> "accepted" (Hospital Dispatched)
# Hospital ID: 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111 (Manipal Old Airport Road)
# Must provide accepted_hospital_id atomically in the same transaction
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/incidents/{{indiranagarIncidentId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "accepted",
  "accepted_hospital_id": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111"
}

### 10. Verify Incident After Acceptance (Should contain populated accepted_hospital object)
GET {{baseUrl}}/incidents/{{indiranagarIncidentId}}
Content-Type: application/json

### 11. Update Incident Status -> "en_route"
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/incidents/{{indiranagarIncidentId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "en_route"
}

### 12. Update Incident Status -> "resolved"
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/incidents/{{indiranagarIncidentId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "resolved"
}


# ====================================================================
# NEGATIVE TEST CASES (Validating error handling and input sanitation)
# ====================================================================

### Negative Test 1: Invalid Coordinates (Latitude > 90) -> Returns 400 Bad Request
POST {{baseUrl}}/incidents
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "latitude": 120.5,
  "longitude": 77.6190
}

### Negative Test 2: Status "accepted" WITHOUT required hospital ID -> Returns 400 Bad Request
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/incidents/{{indiranagarIncidentId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "accepted"
}

### Negative Test 3: Status "accepted" with NON-EXISTENT Hospital UUID -> Returns 400 Bad Request
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/incidents/{{indiranagarIncidentId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "accepted",
  "accepted_hospital_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000"
}

### Negative Test 4: Query Non-Existent Incident UUID -> Returns 404 Not Found
GET {{baseUrl}}/incidents/ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff
Content-Type: application/json

### Negative Test 5: Malformed UUID Parameter -> Returns 400 Bad Request
GET {{baseUrl}}/incidents/invalid-uuid-12345
Content-Type: application/json
